{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The motto of W.A.PU Space Orderty is \u2014 running a business doesn't have to be a hassle or tiring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/47390ea2a6a18a5bf0863ab6e63fe0d0.avif?t=1753625641\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve just launched your very own interstellar freight venture. Each day holds a simple joy: stacking parcels with care, ensuring the cargo ship lifts off steady, and reaping the rewards of a job well done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.poster.avif?t=1753625641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.webm?t=1753625641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.mp4?t=1753625641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stir the vintage cargo management system to life whenever you wish; spruce up your vessel with a quick upgrade; and wonder, who shall don the captain\u2019s hat today?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/e5e6f531fd1c777f8c6d9e1d7d473314.avif?t=1753625641\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this lonely expanse of stars, what tales of longing and sentiment linger within each freight  Email?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.poster.avif?t=1753625641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.webm?t=1753625641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.mp4?t=1753625641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Might these small, steady efforts be enough to help your sister\u2014always ready to lend a hand\u2014chase her dream of forming a band?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/119eee77c4712c0dc68977e3f75adb76.avif?t=1753625641\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here, may you pause or return as you please, mastering your time in a universe that never hurries.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809220?t=1753625641","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/cf7a7958166316261a9b77b2028d037712d0d5a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753625641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/b128465283a62ec6344687ca43b196d139f45890/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753625641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/b128465283a62ec6344687ca43b196d139f45890/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753625641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The motto of W.A.PU Space 